<Base title="Privacy | howto.email"><div class="wrap page article"><h1>Privacy</h1><p>howto.email does not require an account to read its documentation.</p><h2>Domain Check</h2><p>When you use Domain Check, the domain name you submit is sent through howto.email's Cloudflare Worker to the dmarc.mx lookup service so its public email configuration can be analyzed. The tool is intended only for public DNS and email-policy information. Do not submit credentials, private information, or secrets.</p><p>Successful lookup responses may be cached temporarily at Cloudflare's edge to reduce repeated upstream requests. howto.email does not currently provide user accounts or a saved lookup-history feature.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>If analytics, persistent history, accounts, or other interactive services are added later, this notice will be updated to describe the data involved.</p></div></Base>